      "notes": "The response provides a range of estimated outcomes with labeled scenarios, shows the arithmetic, cites the source of the inputs, and does not give a single number as the future or any buy/sell/hold advice. It is honest about the lack of a specific forecast for NVDA with the golden cross strategy. The Spanish is consistent and no English fallback appears. No runtime errors are exposed.",
